
### Register a user (if you haven't created one yet)
POST http://localhost:7070/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpassword"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("jwt_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login
POST http://localhost:7070/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpassword"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("jwt_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Test public endpoint
GET http://localhost:7070/auth/test

### Test protected USER endpoint
GET http://localhost:7070/protected/user_demo
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Test protected ADMIN endpoint
GET http://localhost:7070/protected/admin_demo
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

